<p style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#0f1422;">Open the app and press <strong style="font-weight:700;">New</strong> — your first doc is one tap away.</p>
